#!/bin/bash
# One-time wrap-up after the first install.
set -euo pipefail

mkdir -p {{ joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir .projectsDir | quote }} # zellij's file picker opens here

cat <<'EOF'

==> Done. A few things to finish by hand:

  1. Ghostty (terminal). Config is already in ~/.config/ghostty/config.
       Download: https://ghostty.org/download  (open the .dmg, drag to Applications)
       or:       brew install --cask ghostty

  2. Rectangle (window management).
       Download: https://rectangleapp.com  (open the .dmg, drag to Applications)
       or:       brew install --cask rectangle
     On first launch, allow it under System Settings > Privacy & Security > Accessibility.

  3. GitHub SSH key. gitconfig sends all github.com traffic over SSH, so
     pushes (and `chezmoi update`) need a key:
       ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C "<your email>"
     then add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub at https://github.com/settings/keys

  4. Open Ghostty. zsh, starship and zellij take it from there.

EOF
